{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":495670,"name":"","username":"warpdev","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/warpdev/{size}/46307_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-19T11:32:32.635Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot’s Computer Update/Reset is stuck. Settings shows “Backup not ready” and Update Grok Bot’s Computer cannot proceed. After Reset, UI stays on “Transferring your data” for over 1 hour with no detailed progress. Bot computer itself still responds (box-doctor PASS); this looks like a backend backup/transfer gate, not a local app-only issue.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePlease recover/rebuild the Agent Computer backup/transfer state on the backend for this account.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOpen Grok Bot Settings → Updates → Update Grok Bot’s Computer\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eObserve “Backup not ready” and Update blocked\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFreed ~39GB disk on the Agent Computer; status unchanged\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTried Reset Grok Bot’s Computer; stuck on “Transferring your data” 20+ minutes, then over 1 hour\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSampled box network during wait: ~0 MiB/s RX/TX (transfer not visible on the live box)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUpdate or Reset should complete, or backup should become ready so Update can run.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-operating-system-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-operating-system-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eOperating System\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOther\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-version-information-6\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-version-information-6\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eVersion Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot desktop. Agent Computer: box-doctor all PASS. OS of the desktop client not specified beyond timezone Asia/Seoul.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-additional-information-7\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-additional-information-7\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAdditional Information\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-actual-8\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-actual-8\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eActual\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e“Backup not ready” persists; Reset data transfer never finishes.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-environment-9\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-environment-9\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eEnvironment\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProduct: Grok Bot desktop\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTimezone: Asia/Seoul\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWhen: 2026-09-19 evening KST\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAgent Computer healthy enough for chat/tools; box-doctor all PASS\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDisk after cleanup: ~47% used / ~64GB free\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-already-tried-10\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-already-tried-10\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eAlready tried\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDisk cleanup (~39GB: Unity Hub/projects/caches), Update retry, Reset, long wait. In-app SendFeedback unavailable (privacy mode).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-495670-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-495670-does-this-stop-you-from-using-cursor-11\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDoes this stop you from using Cursor\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSometimes - I can sometimes use Cursor\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-19T11:32:43.567Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":22,"reads":10,"readers_count":9,"score":112.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":172343,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-update-reset-stuck-on-backup-not-ready-endless-transferring-data","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://forum.cursor.com/t/grok-bot-backup-not-ready-all-screens-in-use-box-healthy-update-blocked/173022","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Grok Bot: Backup not ready + all screens in use (box healthy; Update blocked)","clicks":0}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":39822,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-update-reset-stuck-on-backup-not-ready-endless-transferring-data/172343/1","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":496235,"name":"Colin","username":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-20T08:42:46.973Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/warpdev\"\u003e@warpdev\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI checked and your box should be in a healthy state again. Can you confirm?\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-20T08:42:46.973Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":1.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":172343,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-update-reset-stuck-on-backup-not-ready-endless-transferring-data","display_username":"Colin","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Community Support Engineer","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":87436,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-update-reset-stuck-on-backup-not-ready-endless-transferring-data/172343/5","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":496285,"name":"","username":"warpdev","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/warpdev/{size}/46307_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-20T10:36:37.939Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThanks for checking. To clarify: the Agent Computer itself is working fine for normal use (chat, tools, box-doctor all PASS). The problem is specifically that \u003cstrong\u003eUpdate Grok Bot’s Computer\u003c/strong\u003e still cannot run — Settings still shows \u003cstrong\u003e“Backup not ready”\u003c/strong\u003e, so the update is blocked. Healthy runtime ≠ update unblocked.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConversation ID: \u003ccode\u003e7ce50199-43ef-4060-be69-ab8f05638b3a\u003c/code\u003e. Ticket T-F98010. Asia/Seoul, just rechecked.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-20T10:40:58.677Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":6.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":172343,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-update-reset-stuck-on-backup-not-ready-endless-transferring-data","display_username":"","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":39822,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-update-reset-stuck-on-backup-not-ready-endless-transferring-data/172343/7","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":504407,"name":"Colin","username":"Colin","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/colin/{size}/90452_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-30T22:34:09.944Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHey \u003ca class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/warpdev\"\u003e@warpdev\u003c/a\u003e, sorry this has dragged on so long.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUnfortunately, we would probably have to start you on a fresh, empty Grok Bot’s Computer to get you working again, which means the files on the old one would be lost. Here is why:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWhen the computer lost its connection to our servers on Sep 19, it stopped backing up. The old computer has since been removed, so the only copy left is the backup from Sep 19 (from before your disk cleanup).\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eThat backup is very large (over 1.5 million files). Every time we try to restore it onto a new computer, it runs out of space about two thirds of the way through, even after we gave it a much larger disk.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWe have retried this many times over the past few days, and it fails the same way every time. We do not see a way to make it fit in the near term.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAre you okay with us resetting it to a clean computer? You would be able to update normally again afterwards.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":15,"post_type":1,"posts_count":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-30T22:34:09.944Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":1,"readers_count":0,"score":0.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":172343,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-update-reset-stuck-on-backup-not-ready-endless-transferring-data","display_username":"Colin","primary_group_name":"CursorStaff","flair_name":"CursorStaff","flair_url":"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/a/d/ad08adc640929ae1e98be69dab1ad0844cee99a0.png","flair_bg_color":"","flair_color":"","flair_group_id":42,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Community Support Engineer","title_is_group":false,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":true,"admin":true,"staff":true,"user_id":87436,"hidden":false,"trust_level":3,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"